# raw/ no longer lives here -- the 83 source PDFs (208MB) were relocated on 2026-08-20 to
# ~/Dropbox/Research Library/Localization/raw/. This rule stays as a guard: if PDFs are ever
# dropped back in, they must not enter git. They are published papers, re-retrievable, and
# they never delta-compress. Article frontmatter still cites them as "raw/<file>", relative
# to the library root above -- see CLAUDE.md.
raw/

# macOS metadata
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# graphify's extraction cache. The graph data itself was deleted as outdated on 2026-08-20
# (0659102); this directory survived that removal and was deleted on the same day's follow-up.
# It is regenerable tool output, and it does not survive a move: stat-index.json keys entries
# by absolute path, so 79 of its 109 entries already pointed at the in-vault raw/ paths that
# the Dropbox relocation retired. Keep it out of git -- Stage 2/3 will move this folder.
cache/
